updated_at: "2026-11-14T20:24:06.222Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T13:52:29.910Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Verified released v2026.11.14 by the canonical Git ref API and local peeled tag: 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c; GitHub publication time 06:06:41Z. Caller retains the canonical daily/hourly schedule, permission union and retirement inputs; package-owned activation/version hooks are preserved. All four package changelog hooks already explicitly contain include-empty, retained without duplication. Canonical live tag checker verifies this caller and strict YAML parsing plus actionlint v1.7.12 pass. Focused workflow contracts pass; reverting only release.yml to the copied original in disposable fixtures gives 5 failed and 1 passed of 6. Installed pm-ops 2026.11.6 rejects checks:read, so the existing attestation gate needs a compatible validator dependency; the queue rule reserves that bump for Dependabot unless explicitly authorized. Do not weaken permissions or attestation to hide this prerequisite. An exception request is pending, and no dependency bump is assumed. Activation remains unverified until the first scheduled or orchestrator-dispatched run passes the cross-repository OIDC identity preflight. npm trusted publisher stays on this package repository and release.yml. No merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T14:12:27.018Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Focused workflow contracts passed 6/6 and linked pm test passed 6/6. A real empty tracker and dependency-only Git window using the actual pm-changelog 2026.11.10 and package hooks passed generation, notes, pre-tag and post-tag checks. Both pilots pass actionlint v1.7.12, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing and canonical live tag verification. Regenerated changelog:check is green. The installed pm-ops 2026.11.6 validator is a confirmed pre-merge blocker for the required checks:read permission; no dependency bump was made without authorization. A broad local npm sweep was stopped in an unchanged long-running repair-model test after this blocker was already demonstrated; no full npm/Bun pass is claimed and no test process remains. Preparing a draft pilot PR with this prerequisite and the first-run cross-repository OIDC activation gate explicit. Central ops-release-diagnosis-propagation rollout receipts will be recorded on both pilot items per the no-pm-ops-change instruction. No #275 push, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T14:54:58.320Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rollout receipt for central ops-release-diagnosis-propagation / unbraind/pm-ops#272, recorded on pilot items because pm-ops itself is unchanged: pm-lint https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/pull/85; pm-jira https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/209. Both are draft PRs, not merged or activated. Pin: v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c, independently verified through canonical Git ref API, local peeled tag and public npm version. Remaining 34 authorized packages: pm-ado, pm-beads, pm-brand, pm-brief, pm-case, pm-changelog, pm-context, pm-csv, pm-evidence, pm-gantt-chart, pm-github, pm-glossary, pm-graph, pm-http, pm-hypothesis, pm-jev, pm-linear, pm-memory, pm-presets, pm-reduce, pm-review, pm-rl, pm-rlm, pm-rust, pm-screen, pm-slack, pm-slack-standup, pm-starter, pm-swarm, pm-todos, pm-ts-starter, pm-unit, pm-vcs, pm-web. Exclude pm-cli. Published pm-ops 2026.11.14, installed only in a disposable validator probe, recognizes both callers with zero attestation failures; repository pm-ops pins remain 2026.11.6 under dependency ownership, and a compatible validator remains a pre-merge prerequisite. pm-lint also reproduces existing pm-changelog#337 after tagging; stop that component sub-part and retain its issue link. pm-jira actual generator/hook probe passed generation, notes, pre-tag and post-tag checks. Required migration gates pass: actionlint, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing, canonical live tag checker, regenerated changelog:check, focused workflow contracts (pm-lint 42/42 plus tracking 1/1; pm-jira 6/6), and linked pm test 6/6 per pilot. No full npm/Bun certification is claimed; CI remains visible at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/209/checks. Waited for the shared-runner hold before pushing. Keep the activation gate: first scheduled or orchestrator-dispatched cross-repository OIDC preflight must pass; trusted publisher stays on the pilot repository and release.yml with no setting change. No #275 push, review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication. Leave this item unclosed and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-14T15:28:56.046Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orchestrator explicitly authorized the pm-ops devDependency bump to published 2026.11.14. Resume this existing pilot item, keep the workflow SHA unchanged, update only the authorized dependency and applicable lockfiles, and rerun caller/YAML/actionlint/changelog/attestation gates. Jira goes ready for review after its gates pass; lint remains draft on existing pm-changelog#337 until its fix is released. No review-thread mutation, merge, dispatch, publication or pm-ops#275 push."
  "2026-11-14T15:35:17.870Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Authorized continuation: installed exact published pm-ops 2026.11.14 and updated package-lock.json; no Bun lockfile exists. Only that dependency changed. Focused workflow/attestation/changelog-date tests pass 35/35 including 6 caller contracts, zero failures/skips; linked pm test passes 6/6. Actionlint v1.7.12 passes, strict workflow and Dependabot YAML parse passes 2/2, and the installed publish-attestation verifier accepts the unchanged canonical SHA caller with zero failures. The old validator prerequisite is resolved without weakening permissions. Regenerate CHANGELOG.md and check it after this final tracker write. Jira PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/209 goes first and will be marked ready after gates pass; lint PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/pull/85 stays draft until pm-changelog#337 is fixed and released. Shared-runner hold is active; pushes wait for it. Current-head CI will be visible at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/209/checks; no full local npm/Bun certification is claimed. Activation still requires the first scheduled or orchestrator-dispatched Verify npm will accept this workflow's OIDC identity step to pass. Trusted publisher stays configured for this repository and release.yml. Both pilot links and the remaining 34-package list for central ops-release-diagnosis-propagation remain in this item and docs/release-pilot.md; pm-cli excluded. No pm-ops change or #275 push, merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-14T20:20:06.073Z",codex-followups-1114,"PR 209 review follow-up: declare the YAML parser used by test/release-workflow.test.ts directly in devDependencies. The existing lockfile resolves yaml 2.9.1; install that exact version, preserve the SDK pin, verify root manifest/lockfile agreement and rerun the workflow tests and typecheck. No Bun lockfile is tracked."
  "2026-11-14T20:24:02.883Z",codex-followups-1114,"Declared exact yaml 2.9.1 with NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null npm install -D --save-exact yaml@2.9.1. Root package manifest, lockfile root devDependencies and resolved yaml entry all agree; the same direct-dependency assertion fails against the previous manifest (exit 1). No other package version or lockfile entry changed and no Bun lockfile exists. Pinned pm-linked workflow tests pass 6/6 with no failures/skips; npm run typecheck and npm run build:test pass. No lint script or installed ESLint exists in this repo, so the workflow test also passed the fleet runLintGate with the already installed sibling toolchain. Full gates and pilot OIDC activation remain CI/orchestrator responsibilities."
